    "description": "Test series in Sri Lanka won\u2019t be easy, Gavaskar warns Indian team",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Test-series-in-Sri-Lanka-wont-be-easy-Gavaskar-warns-Indian-team/108-348057",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
