    "chunk_text": "India celebrates 80th Independence Day\n\nIndia celebrated its 80th Independence Day on August 15, 2026, with an official ceremony hosted by High Commissioner Santosh Jha at India House in Colombo 03.\n\nThe flag-hoisting ceremony was attended by members of the Indian community in Sri Lanka and diplomats, and featured elements of Indian culture."
