    "description": "DFCC Bank 2Q earnings fall as costs offset stronger fee income",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/DFCC-Bank-2Q-earnings-fall-as-costs-offset-stronger-fee-income/273-348218",
    "lang": "en",
